@Passage-Text Computer technology is on the verge of providing the ability for individuals and groups to communicate and interact with each other in a totally anonymous manner.
@Passage-Context May’s November 1992 mailing-list post reproduces the manifesto he says he wrote in 1988; this passage predicts anonymous network communication.
@Passage-JevQuestion Does this passage describe a capability the author expected computer technology to enable?
